{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of the following sets of data, the only one that does not determine the shape of a triangle is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/2/f32d56706779de987300ad19931069d4d8a03c96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{the ratio of two sides and the inc{}luded angle}\\\\ \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{the ratios of the three altitudes}\\\\ \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{the ratios of the three medians}\\\\ \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{the ratio of the altitude to the corresponding base}\\\\ \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{two angles}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"399\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />. The ratio of the altitude to the base is insufficient to determine the shape of a triangle; you also need to know the ratio of the two segments into which the altitude divides the base.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1951 AHS